# Build context for infra/docker/outcome-training/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore): everything
# is excluded except what the image copies, so the repo's data, clones and models never reach the build.
*
!infra/docker/outcome-training/
!pipelines/training/outcome_features.py
!pipelines/training/outcome/
!pipelines/evaluation/eval_script.py
pipelines/training/outcome/models/
pipelines/training/outcome/predictions/
pipelines/training/outcome/mlruns/
pipelines/training/outcome/experiments/
pipelines/training/outcome/eval/*/predictions.csv
pipelines/training/outcome/eval/*/train.csv
**/__pycache__/
